<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0F172A', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 80, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 38, background: 'linear-gradient(180deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)', borderRadius: 3 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>模块五 · 应用总装（陈浩研）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B5CF6', marginLeft: 12, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>组长 · 从零件到整车</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '47%', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 13 }}>
      <Box style={{ padding: '12px 16px', background: 'rgba(139,92,246,0.12)', borderRadius: 10, borderLeft: '4px solid #8B5CF6' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>定位：把四个模块<span style={{ color: '#8B5CF6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>拼成可运行的整体</span>。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>main.py</span>：FastAPI 入口，include_router 总装配全部 18 个路由。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>中间件</span>：cache / ratelimit / logging 统一挂载。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• 路由前缀规整（/simulate、/auth、/quiz…），模块边界清晰。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>作为组长，负责全局衔接与一致性把关。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '53%', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <svg width='540' height='320' viewBox='0 0 540 320'>
        <defs>
          <marker id='ar22' markerWidth='9' markerHeight='9' refX='7' refY='3' orient='auto'>
            <path d='M0,0 L7,3 L0,6 Z' fill='#64748B' />
          </marker>
        </defs>
        <rect x='180' y='14' width='180' height='52' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#8B5CF6' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='270' y='38' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold'>main.py 入口</text>
        <text x='270' y='56' textAnchor='middle' fill='#C4B5FD' fontSize='12'>include_router</text>
        <rect x='30' y='150' width='150' height='50' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='105' y='174' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='14' fontWeight='bold'>18 个路由</text>
        <text x='105' y='192' textAnchor='middle' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12'>api/v1</text>
        <rect x='195' y='150' width='150' height='50' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='270' y='174' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='14' fontWeight='bold'>中间件</text>
        <text x='270' y='192' textAnchor='middle' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12'>cache/limit/log</text>
        <rect x='360' y='150' width='150' height='50' rx='10' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2' />
        <text x='435' y='174' textAnchor='middle' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='14' fontWeight='bold'>仪表盘</text>
        <text x='435' y='192' textAnchor='middle' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12'>汇总</text>
        <line x1='270' y1='66' x2='105' y2='150' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar22)' />
        <line x1='270' y1='66' x2='270' y2='150' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar22)' />
        <line x1='270' y1='66' x2='435' y2='150' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar22)' />
      </svg>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 56, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, padding: '0 18px', background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(139,92,246,0.18), rgba(59,130,246,0.06))', borderRadius: 10, border: '1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.35)' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B5CF6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>答辩亮点</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17.5, color: '#E2E8F0' }}>总装车间：一个入口挂载全部路由与中间件，模块再多也不乱——这是组长的工程统合力。</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>实战避错系统 · 团队分工</Text>
